            "review_title": "Review at Hai Phương Noodles Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Loc N\n2 contributions\n0\nYummy Vietnamese Dishes\nDec 2023 • Friends\nThe food here tasted amazing and the staff were so friendly. The restaurant also looked very clean and you were able to see how clean it is through the kitchen too.\n\nThey make their own egg noodles in house and sometimes you are able to see them make the noodles in their workshop on the second level. There’s a dish here for everyone!\n\nThe Viet couple who run the restaurant lived in Australia their whole lives and just moved back to Vietnam and set up this restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 6, 2024",
